  "description": "There’s an adult toy shop with glowing five-star reviews. Mina, convinced that her body just doesn’t respond the way it should, can’t help but be curious. So when her friend makes a reservation at the shop, she finally works up the courage to go. What she doesn’t expect is for Heetae, the shop’s handsome owner, to offer her a private trial session. A casual test run quickly turns into something she doesn’t want to end. And then, Heetae suggests a very special toy…\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
